cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite the paper (preferred-citation); if you use the W2C simulation code, also cite the software."
title: "words-to-coordinates: simulation study and preprint for an uncertainty-aware NLP-geospatial framework for climate risk disclosure"
abstract: >-
  Code, cached results and preprint for Words to Coordinates (W2C), a framework
  that links what firms disclose about physical climate risk to what their
  assets face. Includes a closed-form relation between geolocation error and
  exposure fidelity, the Disclosure Gap Index with disclosure-exposure
  quadrants, and a simulation study on the real locations of 11,107 power
  plants with Monte Carlo propagation of extraction, geolocation and
  hazard-model uncertainty.
type: software
